WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,080
Zhang Hao is a confirmed dead man

2
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:04,740
Then Shen Cheng

3
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:07,420
Shen Cheng was not included in the death toll.

4
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:10,090
He should not be dead

5
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:13,370
Broadcast statistics are never wrong if the numbers don't match

6
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,770
That might mean he's still alive

7
00:00:14,770 --> 00:00:15,970
What if Zhang Hao is the one who survives?

8
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:17,730
I'm Zhang Hao now. It's impossible.

9
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:22,140
I saw with my own eyes that he was stabbed in the police artery, that's fine

10
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,280
This thing just rushed over to kill him.

11
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,520
Mom can't even see her eyes anymore

12
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,920
help quickly

13
00:00:50,610 --> 00:01:05,890
The police didn't have a car to paint him over.

14
00:01:06,210 --> 00:01:07,690
This potion can synthesize toxins
